---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/profile.css';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="profile-page">

    <section class="profile-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="page-label">About</p>

        <h1>
          I like knowing what my systems
          <span>are actually doing.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>

      <p class="profile-intro">
        I'm Jonas Németh, a systems administrator
        based in Gothenburg, Sweden.
      </p>
    </section>


    <section class="about-story">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>Background</span>
        <h2>Work, studies and home projects.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>
          I work with systems administration in healthcare, primarily with
          Melior. That includes configuration, access management and
          troubleshooting, as well as investigating integrations and logs.
        </p>

        <p>
          I have studied Information Technology at Chalmers. Outside work,
          I spend a lot of time learning more about Linux, networking,
          automation and embedded systems by building things of my own.
        </p>

        <p>
          Most of my projects start with something I want at home: a server,
          a segmented network, a room sensor or an automation. I enjoy
          getting it working and figuring out what went wrong when it does not.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="interests-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>What interests me</span>

        <h2>
          Things I keep
          coming back to.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="interest-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Networking</h3>
          <p>
            Routing, segmentation, DNS and remote access on my home network.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Linux & infrastructure</h3>
          <p>
            Running services in Docker on my Ubuntu server, including
            configuration, updates and troubleshooting.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Automation</h3>
          <p>
            Finding ways to remove repetitive work, from small scripts
            to home automations.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>Embedded systems</h3>
          <p>
            Building room sensors with microcontrollers and connecting them
            to Home Assistant.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="about-closing">
      <div>
        <span>Elsewhere</span>

        <h2>
          Projects, code
          and experience.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-links">
        <a href="/projects">
          View projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/cv">
          View CV <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/Pdoxxy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
